            "text": "Substitute n = t/{a}, so that the fraction becomes 1/t.",
            "latex": "= \\lim_{t\\to\\infty}\\left(1+\\frac{1}{t}\\right)^{\\frac{t}{{a}}}"
          },
          {
            "text": "Write it as a power of the fundamental limit.",
            "latex": "= \\lim_{t\\to\\infty}\\left(\\left(1+\\frac{1}{t}\\right)^{t}\\right)^{\\frac{1}{{a}}} = e^{\\frac{1}{{a}}}"
          }
        ]
      },
