            "text": "Substitute m = n + {b} and split the power.",
            "latex": "= \\lim_{m\\to\\infty}\\left(1+\\frac{{a}}{m}\\right)^{m}\\cdot\\left(1+\\frac{{a}}{m}\\right)^{-{b}}"
          },
          {
            "text": "The first factor tends to e raised to {a} and the second one tends to 1.",
            "latex": "= e^{{a}}\\cdot 1 = e^{{a}}"
          }
