            "text": "Make both fundamental limits appear.",
            "latex": "= \\lim_{x\\to 0}\\frac{\\arctan {a}x}{{a}x}\\cdot\\frac{{b}x}{\\ln\\left(1+{b}x\\right)}\\cdot\\frac{{a}}{{b}}"
